document "Minecraft Controls"

description "A complete controls reference for Minecraft Bedrock Edition, including default controls and configurable key bindings."

topic "Controls"

    description "Learn the controls for Minecraft Bedrock Edition on keyboard and mouse, controllers, and touchscreen devices."

    section "About Controls"

        text
            Minecraft Bedrock Edition supports keyboard and mouse, game controllers, and touchscreen controls.

            Keyboard and mouse controls can be customized through the Controls settings. Controller controls can also be customized where supported by the current version and platform.

            Touch controls use configurable touchscreen layouts rather than traditional keyboard key bindings.
        end

        note
            Your controls may be different from the defaults in this guide if you have changed your control settings.
        end

        note
            Some controls are only available in certain menus, game modes, or situations.
        end

    end

    section "Keyboard And Mouse"

        subsection "Movement"

            list
                Move Forward — W
                Move Backward — S
                Move Left — A
                Move Right — D
                Jump — Space
                Sneak — Left Shift
                Sprint — Left Control
            end

        end

