        subsection "Configurable Key Bindings"

            text
                The following actions can be assigned to keyboard and mouse inputs through the Keyboard and Mouse controls settings. The exact list can vary by Minecraft Bedrock version and enabled features.
            end

            list
                Move Forward
                Move Backward
                Move Left
                Move Right
                Jump
                Sneak
                Sprint
                Attack / Destroy
                Use Item / Place Block
                Pick Block
                Drop Item
                Open Inventory
                Swap Item With Off-Hand
                Hotbar Slot 1
                Hotbar Slot 2
                Hotbar Slot 3
                Hotbar Slot 4
                Hotbar Slot 5
                Hotbar Slot 6
                Hotbar Slot 7
                Hotbar Slot 8
                Hotbar Slot 9
                Previous Hotbar Slot
                Next Hotbar Slot
                Open Chat
                Open Command
                Pause
                Change Perspective
                Hide Interface
                Player List
            end

        end

        subsection "Command Macros"

            text
                Some Bedrock versions include command macro key bindings in Creator Settings. When enabled, additional macro bindings can be assigned to keyboard inputs.

                Command macro bindings run a configured command when the assigned input is pressed while in a world.
            end

            note
                Command macros are an advanced feature and may only appear when the corresponding Creator setting is enabled.
            end

        end

    end

